    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>The equation of the plane passing through the line of intersection of the planes:<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math><br />Parallel to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2<